    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>Create an artist marketplace where creators can sell artworks using WooCommerce. This plugin allows artists to register, upload their artworks, and manage their portfolio while integrating seamlessly with WooCommerce for sales and commission tracking.</p>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Upload the plugin folder to the <code>/wp-content/plugins/</code> directory.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin through the &#8216;Plugins&#8217; menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Configure settings under the &#8216;Artzio&#8217; menu in the admin dashboard.</li>\n</ol>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id='does%20this%20require%20woocommerce%3F'>\nDoes this require WooCommerce?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Yes, this plugin is an extension for WooCommerce.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.0.1</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Fixed minor bugs</li>\n<li>Improved performance</li>\n<li>Security improvements</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Initial release.</li>\n</ul>\n"
